  "description": "A 2D geometry library for engineering drawings. Provides points, vectors, lines, polylines, polygons, circles and oriented rectangles, together with the operations over them: distance, projection, containment, intersection, collision, parallelism, parametrization, merging and splitting. Every comparison is tolerance-aware. It is the 2D counterpart of GeometryHelper.SolidGeometry and shares Tolerance and Angle with it through GeometryHelper.CommonGeometry.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
